Copyright 2026 Flow Steward contributors

This extension packages modified Google MCP Toolbox for Databases v1.3.0,
commit b0010060a939455d91e4f8ba62dc3e72b1892469.
Copyright Google LLC, Apache-2.0 (included in LICENSE).
Source: https://github.com/googleapis/mcp-toolbox

Only PostgreSQL source and postgres-sql tool packages are registered.
The included patch pins endpoint addresses while preserving verified TLS,
disables fallback endpoints, limits PostgreSQL messages and connection reads,
and caps result rows and serialized JSON. Reproducible build pins, patch and
native provenance accompany this package. PostgreSQL protocol is provided by
pgx v5.9.2 (MIT), https://github.com/jackc/pgx; dependencies are recorded in the
pinned upstream go.mod/go.sum and may be inspected using go version -m.

The original connected-node icon is by Flow Steward contributors. PostgreSQL
and pgvector are independent projects; this extension is unaffiliated.
